    "將刪除 %@ 的還款紀錄，並同步刪除對應借貸轉帳。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將刪除 %@ 的還款紀錄，並同步刪除對應借貸轉帳。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除 %@ 的还款紀录，並同步删除对应借贷转账。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will delete %@'s repayment record and the related debt transfer."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@の返済記録と対応する貸借振替を削除します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "將刪除代墊追蹤資料，並嘗試刪除關聯借貸轉帳與自己份額支出。此操作無法復原。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將刪除代墊追蹤資料，並嘗試刪除關聯借貸轉帳與自己份額支出。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除代墊追蹤资料，並嘗试删除关联借贷转账与自己份额支出。此操作无法复原。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will delete the advance tracking data and try to delete related debt transfers and your own share expense. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立替追跡データを削除し、関連する貸借振替と自分の負担分支出の削除も試みます。この操作は元に戻せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "將只刪除代墊追蹤資料，原本的實際交易紀錄會保留。此操作無法復原。": {
      "comment": "An alert message that appears when the user confirms deleting an advance case with only tracking data. It explains that the actual transaction records will be retained and that this action cannot be undone.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將只刪除代墊追蹤資料，原本的實際交易紀錄會保留。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将只删除代墊追蹤资料，原本的实际交易紀录会保留。此操作无法复原。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only advance tracking data will be deleted. Existing actual transaction records will be kept. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立替追跡データのみ削除し、既存の実取引記録は保持されます。この操作は元に戻せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
